# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# loop-kit .gitignore
#
# This repo is the SOURCE of loop-kit (shell + prompt files). Every tracked
# file here ships as the product. The rules below keep local dev byproducts
# and personal working notes out of the repo.
#
# IMPORTANT: `.loop/` and `.claude/` are ANCHORED with a leading `/` on
# purpose. An UNANCHORED rule (e.g. `.loop/`) also swallows the shipped
# `examples/*/.loop/docs/product-contract.md` fixtures and would drop the
# `kit/.claude/**` product skills on a fresh clone/`git init`. Do not remove
# the leading slash.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── OS / editor cruft ──
.DS_Store

# ── Python byproducts (the examples use uv + pytest) ──
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.pytest_cache/

# ── Loop run-state at the repo ROOT only (regenerated each run, never shipped).
#    Anchored so examples/*/.loop/docs/ fixtures stay tracked. ──
/.loop/

# ── Local Claude Code session/settings at the ROOT only.
#    Anchored so the kit/.claude/** product skills stay tracked. ──
/.claude/

# ── Local scratch / promo working areas ──
/scratch/
/promo/

# ── Personal working docs & design notes — keep local, never push ──
/SPEC_AND_DESIGN.md
/evidence-gate-hardening-plan.md
/*-findings.md
/codex-agent-support-design.md
/DESIGN-loop-setup.md
